{"id":"n70490-1-9","stage":5,"title":"어루만지다 · 抚摸","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70490-1-9-1","ko":"뭘 그렇게 품에 안고 어루만지고 있니?","zh":"你怀里抱着什么，一直在轻轻抚摸？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"품에","meaning":"怀，怀里","explanation":"품：怀，怀里；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"품","audio":"/audio/c2fa9dd227de1178187c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83747","senseId":"3","lemma":"품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안고","meaning":"抱","explanation":"안다：抱；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"안다","audio":"/audio/2a5d94e74e544165133b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72225","senseId":"1","lemma":"안다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어루만지고","meaning":"抚摸","explanation":"어루만지다：抚摸；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어루만지다","audio":"/audio/e255bc3cfb7af2b6712b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70490","senseId":"1","lemma":"어루만지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있니?","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"c2fa9dd227de1178","term":"품","zh":"怀，怀里","audio":"/audio/c2fa9dd227de1178187c.mp3","entryId":"83747","definition":"展开双臂拥抱时的胸部。","pronunciation":["품"]},{"id":"2a5d94e74e544165","term":"안다","zh":"抱","audio":"/audio/2a5d94e74e544165133b.mp3","entryId":"72225","definition":"张开双臂将对象揽向胸前或使其进入自己的怀中。","pronunciation":["안ː따"]},{"id":"e255bc3cfb7af2b6","term":"어루만지다","zh":"抚摸","audio":"/audio/e255bc3cfb7af2b6712b.mp3","entryId":"70490","definition":"用手轻柔地触摸。","pronunciation":["어루만지다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a3a3d7f118751c30c7e2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70490-1-9-2","ko":"길에서 새끼 고양이를 주워 왔어요.","zh":"我从路上捡回了一只小猫。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"길에서","meaning":"路上","explanation":"길：路上；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"9","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"새끼","meaning":"崽子，幼崽","explanation":"새끼：崽子，幼崽","readings":[{"term":"새끼","audio":"/audio/3e8d7ac4bb90eeb06215.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66312","senseId":"1","lemma":"새끼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고양이를","meaning":"猫","explanation":"고양이：猫；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"고양이","audio":"/audio/2c4930ad509e4bdce9b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18779","senseId":"1","lemma":"고양이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주워","meaning":"捡","explanation":"줍다：捡；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"줍다","audio":"/audio/d734298af378155884a3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82140","senseId":"3","lemma":"줍다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔어요.","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"路上","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3","entryId":"59251","definition":"移向某处的途中。","pronunciation":["길"]},{"id":"3e8d7ac4bb90eeb0","term":"새끼","zh":"崽子，幼崽","audio":"/audio/3e8d7ac4bb90eeb06215.mp3","entryId":"66312","definition":"出生不久的年幼动物。","pronunciation":["새끼"]},{"id":"2c4930ad509e4bdc","term":"고양이","zh":"猫","audio":"/audio/2c4930ad509e4bdce9b3.mp3","entryId":"18779","definition":"一种可以家养的小动物，在黑暗的地方也能看清事物，擅长捉老鼠。","pronunciation":["고양이"]},{"id":"d734298af3781558","term":"줍다","zh":"捡","audio":"/audio/d734298af378155884a3.mp3","entryId":"82140","definition":"把被遗弃的孩子带回家抚养。","pronunciation":["줍ː따"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3ae8ce25f8f1858c9234.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.349,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70490","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":159,"sequenceScore":3.1757,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我从路上捡回了一只小猫。","裕敏去参加学校歌唱比赛了，对吧？","你怀里抱着什么，一直在轻轻抚摸？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我从路上捡回了一只小猫。","你怀里抱着什么，一直在轻轻抚摸？","裕敏去参加学校歌唱比赛了，对吧？"],"answer":0}]}
